Remove Reduction Support from the Stencil Composition API (#1102)

Note that it is a breaking change. Namely:
 - `make_reduction` is not supported within `make_computation` grammar;
 - `computation` type erasure doesn't have `ReturnType` as a first template argument;
 - `run` method of computation returns `void` now.

